architecture-audit/cycle-008-3d-rendering-scene-adapters/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:266:- `Guide3DSelector`: selected-guide perpendicular-plane DTOs and guide intersection marker DTOs.
architecture-audit/cycle-008-3d-rendering-scene-adapters/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:267:- `Hinge3DSelector`: hinge-line DTOs.
